// ===========================================================================
//  metalstorm_donor  ->  zone_source\metalstorm_donor\mod.ff
//
//  Built by build_metalstorm.bat out of BO2-Reimagined's shipped copy of the
//  CAMPAIGN weapon package  zone\all\weapons!metalstorm_mms_sp.ff.
//
//  WHY AN INTERMEDIATE INSTEAD OF LOADING THAT FILE DIRECTLY
//    1. build_ff.bat runs under EnableDelayedExpansion, where a '!' in a
//       quoted argument is eaten by cmd - and the donor's real filename
//       carries one. It cannot simply be renamed: a T6 fastfile's internal
//       zone name has to match its filename or OAT fails with "inflate of
//       stream N failed: invalid block type" (see build_ff.bat's header).
//    2. Every other donor in this project is a mod.ff in its own folder.
//       This is that same shape, so nothing new has to be learned to read it.
//
//  🛑 THE CAMPAIGN IS NOT INSTALLED ON THIS MACHINE and this package is not in
//  retail's zone\all - measured 2026-09-06 across all 226 files there. Only
//  la_1b.ff (world model + storm materials) and frontend.ff (the HUD icon)
//  carry any of it; the VIEW model, all 24 view anims and the sound-alias
//  table exist in no retail fastfile, so Reimagined's shipped copy is the
//  only source. CLAUDE.md's no-import rule is explicitly overridden for
//  BO2-Reimagined, which is what makes this route legitimate here.
// ===========================================================================
>game,T6

