// 🛑 THE SIX CAMPAIGN weapon DEFS AND THEIR keyvaluepairs/rawfile ARE
// DELIBERATELY NOT CARRIED. They are the _sp (single-player) defs; this mod
// ships its own _zm defs raw in weapons\zm\ instead, which is the route this
// project has already proven (a raw def under 20,480 B beats even the map's
// own fastfile - see CLAUDE.md). Dropping them also sidesteps the Linker
// weapon-copy hazard entirely. Every asset those defs referenced is still
// listed above by name, so nothing the gun draws or plays is lost.
